      <!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Vibes</title>
  <style>
    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      background: #f5f6f8;
    }

    header {
      background: #111827;
      color: white;
      padding: 18px;
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 26px;
      font-weight: bold;
    }

    .welcome {
      padding: 20px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .welcome h1 {
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .news {
      background: white;
      margin: 12px;
      padding: 16px;
      border-radius: 12px;
    }

    .news h2 {
      margin-top: 0;
    }

    button {
      background: #111827;
      color: white;
      border: none;
      padding: 10px 18px;
      border-radius: 8px;
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <header>VIBES</header>

  <div class="welcome">
    <h1>Welcome to Vibes</h1>
    <p>Your daily news, your way.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="news">
    <h2>📰 Today's News</h2>
    <p>Discover what's happening around you and around the world.</p>
    <button>Read More</button>
  </div>

  <div class="news">
    <h2>🔥 Trending Vibes</h2>
    <p>See what people are talking about today.</p>
    <button>Explore</button>
  </div>

</body>
</html>
